{% set routeFact = trip.evidence.facts | selectattr("id", "equalto", "route-readiness") | first %}
<section id="recommendation-readiness" class="divider evidence-section">
  <div class="section-label"><p class="eyebrow">Recommendation Readiness</p><h2>Appeal, readiness, and confidence</h2><p>The /50 score describes family appeal. It does not certify a future schedule, a live quote, or booking readiness.</p></div>
  <div class="evidence-summary-grid">
    <article><span>Appeal score</span><strong>{{ trip.main.scorecard.totalBaked }}/50</strong><p>Budget remains double-weighted; PTO remains optional.</p></article>
    <article><span>Route readiness</span><strong>{{ routeFact["value"]["status"] | replace("-", " ") | title }}</strong><p>{{ routeFact.confidence | title }} confidence · recheck by {{ (routeFact.expiresAt | displayDate) if routeFact.expiresAt else "when material facts change" }}</p></article>
    <article><span>Evidence confidence</span><strong>{{ trip.evidence.overallConfidence | title }}</strong><p>Weakest supported score axis · reviewed {{ trip.evidence.reviewedAt | displayDate }}. This measures support for the score, not whether the route is ready to book.{% if trip.evidence.overallConfidence != "high" and trip.evidence.limitingAxes.length %}<br><b>Limited by:</b> {{ trip.evidence.limitingAxes | join(", ") }}.{% endif %}</p></article>
    <article><span>Budget preference</span><strong>{% if trip.main.scorecard.budget.ceilUsd <= 12000 %}At/below target{% elif trip.main.scorecard.budget.ceilUsd <= 15000 %}Within $15k preference{% elif trip.main.scorecard.budget.floorUsd <= 15000 %}Range crosses $15k{% else %}Likely above $15k{% endif %}</strong><p>{{ trip.main.scorecard.budget.floorUsd | moneyK }}&ndash;{{ trip.main.scorecard.budget.ceilUsd | moneyK }} planning band. Cost never hides this itinerary.</p></article>
  </div>
  <details class="verification-log">
    <summary>What changed in this recommendation?</summary>
    <ul>{%- for event in verificationLog.events -%}{% if event.scope == "all" or event.scope == trip.slug %}<li><time datetime="{{ event.date }}">{{ event.date }}</time> &mdash; {{ event.summary }}</li>{% endif %}{%- endfor -%}</ul>
  </details>
</section>
